'''Blinky Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that can be obtained from the [[PAC-MAN Collaboration Event/Event Gacha|Event Gacha]] during the [[PAC-MAN Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 15.5 Update|Version 15.5]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 867
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Blinky Cat
|name2 = Blinky Cat CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Blinky Cat CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Very similar to [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Cat]] in terms of usage. Cheap and expendable, it can be summoned en masse to take hits in place of other, more important units. This meatshield role is quite valuable, if not for the wide selection of cats able to perform this role, usually with a lower cost.

Blinky Cat, however, has the ability to [[Dodge Attack|dodge]] Alien enemies. This doesn't help it much though, since the chance is somewhat low. It might be somewhat useful in pure-Alien stages, but other than that, it's better to use cheaper meatshields, such as [[Catburger (Special Cat)|Catburger]].

{{Job|Classification = Meatshield}}

